16	 * {@code sharesHousehold} true and an existing owner shares its normalized last name and
17	 * address (see {@link AddressNormalizer}), the two share a household: a stable
18	 * {@code householdId} is stamped on the new owner and on every existing member, and the
19	 * household's size is recorded on all of them. Otherwise the owner is a household of one.
20	 *
